Actual middle tangent: 0. First interval right-clamped: true.

| finite query | native value |
| ---: | ---: |
| -1 | 0 |
| 0 | 0 |
| 0.5 | 0.625 |
| 1 | 1 |
| 1.5 | -36.875 |
| 2 | -100 |
| 3 | -100 |
